{"symbol":"IPO.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T23:07:56Z","info":{"address1":"Cholerzyn 382","city":"Liszki","zip":"32-060","country":"Poland","phone":"48 12 444 8888","fax":"48 12 444 8000","website":"https://www.intersport.pl","industry":"Specialty Retail","industryKey":"specialty-retail","industryDisp":"Specialty Retail","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","sectorKey":"consumer-cyclical","sectorDisp":"Consumer Cyclical","longBusinessSummary":"Intersport Polska S.A. engages in the retail and wholesale of clothing, footwear, and sports equipment for men, women, and children in Poland. The company offers clothes comprising t-shirts, sweatshirts, pants, shorts, underwear, hiking vests, tracksuits, swimsuits, swimming trunks, running hats, baseball caps, jackets, fleeces, balaclavas, gloves, winter hats, and masks; footwear consisting of everyday shoes, running shoes, hiking boots, football boots, cycling shoes, training shoes, tennis shoes, volleyball shoes, basketball shoes, handball shoes, hiking sandals, pool flip-flops, and water shoes; and sports products for tourism, football, running, bicycles, water sports, fitness, training, triathlon, team sports, racquet sports, school and sports activities, combat sports, recreation, roller skating, scooters, sleds and apples, and winter sports, as well as Olympic and Sportstyle collection products. It also provides backpacks, bags, and wind stoppers. The company sells its products through stationary stores and e-commerce channels. In addition, the company is involved in retail sale conducted by mail order houses or the Internet; retail sale of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages in specialized stores; tourism organizer activities; and rental and leasing of recreational and sports equipment. Intersport Polska S.A. was founded in 1988 and is based in Liszki, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":229,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Aivars  Bunde","title":"President of Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":48